        "question": "Why does my VPN disconnect when the Firestick goes to sleep?",
        "answer": "Fire OS aggressively kills background apps to save memory when the device goes into \"Screensaver\" or sleep mode. When you wake it up, the VPN tunnel is broken. You simply need to tap \"Connect\" again in the NordVPN app before launching your streaming app."
